%% Governed agent ops: dispatcher to verifier to approvals.
flowchart TD
    Cron[Single cron line every 5 min] --> D[Dispatcher]
    D --> J[(jobs)]
    D -->|limits: 1 per role, 3 total| L[Agent loop]
    L --> TA[Per-role tool allow-list]
    TA --> Tool[Tool]
    Tool --> PII[PII scan on tool result]
    PII --> L
    L -.->|per-role spend-capped key| GW[LLM gateway]
    GW -.->|HTTP 402| BE[budget_exhausted event]
    L --> CC[Compliance check: YAML rules, deterministic first, LLM for judgment only]
    L --> AP[Approval queue: never proceeds on silence]
    L -->|structured JSON final turn| E[(events)]
    E --> VF[Verifier: outcome checks, no LLM, no shared code]
    VF --> VR[(verifier results)]
    VR --> D
    D -->|zero events written| SU[Mark run suspicious]
    D -->|2 consecutive failures| AD[Auto-disable job + alert]
    EV[Model eval harness] -->|passing scorecard under 90 days old| CH[Role charter model choice]
    CH --> L
